{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんこんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神奈川県出身 21歳"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "日向坂46  五期生のまつおさくらです。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いて下さり本当にありがとうございます。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "in 神戸"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたし、タイトル通り神戸のトリコになって帰ってきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて訪れたんだけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか、私のセンサーが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "爆音を奏でてる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "貴方ここに戻ってきなさいって"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobIWm91d.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobl5eZ3O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、目が合った"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんと目が合うと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "笑顔になろうとする顔を止められねえ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたし、こういう場所に出会うために日本を旅行してるんだなって感じるくらい好きだった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ただカフェにいるだけで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーあ神戸って素敵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "古着を見てるだけで"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーあ神戸って素敵"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お気に入りの古着屋さん見つけたから、神戸行ったら毎回行くことを決めた。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸牛を食べてても、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーあ神戸って素敵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "肉を焼けッッ！꒰՞o̴̶̷̤ ̫ o̴̶̷̤՞꒱"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私も焼けって？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobk6nSaz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "我は上手く焼けるんだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "君への焼肉特訓だ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "異人館を訪れても、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーあ神戸って素敵"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobUoiV4m.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobwpHsbX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸が好きすぎる病にかかった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けど診察はいらないです"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "このままかかっていたいから"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『あーあ神戸って素敵』"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の流行語でいいよもう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "異人館巡りした時に、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イタリア館にいちばん行きたくて、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "営業時間が迫ってるかもって"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "キャリーケースを持ったまま"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "すんごい傾斜の坂を走って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(本当に60度くらいあった)"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ようやく到着したんだけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ドアが空いてなくて、調べたら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『閉館しました』"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "調べなかった私が悪い。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもその思い出ができたから、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イタリア館が閉館していたから、可愛い色の萌黄の館に出会えたと考えると"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あーあ神戸って素敵"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ん？ってなるよね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "言いたいだけじゃない？って"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "別に流行らそうとしてないよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "流行らそうとしてる割には"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトル「トリコ｣だし、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "気付いた？"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobGFGcsA.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰かが来た！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "隠れろッッ！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "存在を消せッッ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "消せてないよ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんなきゅるきゅるの"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Kの字もない表情あるかな"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mob20SjLZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絵文字でどうにか頑張ったんだけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "眩しかったから多分この表情。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もはや儚いかなとか考えてみたけど、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いや反対、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "めっちゃ居座りそう。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まじでもういいよってくらい消えてくれ無なさそう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなと私の毎晩"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "多分こんな感じ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202610/mobHOXz6I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちさちゃんも"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大きいベッドでーすって喜んでた"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "修学旅行みんなと話してたタイプかなあ。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちさちゃん好きな人とかいるの？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お師匠(私)でーす"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "神戸の心残りは、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢BE KOBE｣のモニュメントに行けなかったこと。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次訪れた時は絶対に行こう。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私港町が好きなのかも知れない。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "メイクさんが長崎もおすすめしてくれた！今度長崎行ってみたいな⚓️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "姉らぶりーと行ったんだけど、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "姉は神戸初めてじゃなかったらしくて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何回も、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うわーここ来たな～"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりだわ、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "何回目だわ、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしーーー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "って"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うるさいッッ！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっと神戸を褒めろッッ！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日土曜23:00~Venue101さんに出演させていただきます！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46さんと共演です！お互いの魅力がたくさん伝わりますように〜🍀"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルタイムでも録画でも、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ見てください！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いいたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなくり2026のローソンチケット先行が本日の12:00~開始しました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/26 23:59までです！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ会いに来てください"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://l-tike.com/concert/mevent/?mid=306614"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お仕事、生活、学校、色々あった方は、お疲れ様！また明日も一緒に頑張ろうね！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからお仕事や予定がある方も一緒に頑張ろ🌟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私が頑張れー！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってずーっと応援しているよ"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたの頑張りは桜が見ているからね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も素敵な一日になりますように。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "読んでくれて本当にありがとう！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日も元気にさくラブリー ( ̳- ·̫ - ̳ˆ )◞❤︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#sakulovelog"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "110さく"}], "source": "official"}